---
import PageShell from "../components/PageShell.astro";
import { getHackathons } from "../lib/hackathons";

const hackathons = getHackathons();
const completed = Math.max(...hackathons.map(({ number }) => number));
const awarded = hackathons.filter(({ award }) => Boolean(award)).length;

const career = [
  { label: "Foundation", title: "Consulting at NCS", copy: "Learned to deliver inside large systems, with real constraints and real stakeholders." },
  { label: "Ownership", title: "Freelance software engineer", copy: "Moved closer to customers, scope, pricing, and the consequences of every promise." },
  { label: "Scale", title: "UBS & DBS", copy: "Spent four years building in banking, where reliability, rigour, and trust are part of the product." },
  { label: "Now", title: "Agentic AI at Sembcorp", copy: "Building full-stack GenAI products and agent workflows at the intersection of software and operations." },
  { label: "Next", title: "Founder / operator", copy: "Turning technical range into owned products, scalable systems, distribution, and durable value." },
];

const principles = [
  { number: "01", title: "Ship to learn", copy: "A working prototype reveals more than another week of private certainty." },
  { number: "02", title: "Repetition creates range", copy: "Different rooms, teams, and constraints turn raw skills into adaptable judgement." },
  { number: "03", title: "Own the outcome", copy: "The job is not merely to build the thing. It is to make the thing matter." },
  { number: "04", title: "Compound the record", copy: "Every attempt should leave behind an asset: code, insight, trust, a story, or a new option." },
];
---

<PageShell
  title="About Sayyid Khan | The 100 Hackathoner"
  description="Meet Sayyid Khan, a Singapore-based AI engineer using 100 hackathons as a laboratory for becoming a sharper builder, operator, and founder."
>
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="container hero-grid">
      <div class="hero-copy">
        <p class="meta">The builder behind the record</p>
        <h1>Builder by trade.<br /><em>Operator in training.</em></h1>
        <p class="hero-intro">
          I’m Sayyid Khan, a Singapore-based AI engineer turning one hundred
          hackathons into a long-running experiment in building, leadership,
          commercial instinct, and founder judgement.
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a class="button primary" href="/hackathons/">Explore the journey</a>
          <a class="text-link" href="#story">Read my story <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <figure class="portrait">
        <div class="portrait-index" aria-hidden="true">{completed}</div>
        <img
          src="/images/about/sayyid-khan-portrait.webp"
          alt="Portrait of Sayyid Khan wearing a red and white keffiyeh and maroon thobe"
          width="1122"
          height="1402"
          loading="eager"
          fetchpriority="high"
        />
        <figcaption>
          <span>Sayyid Khan</span>
          <span>Singapore · 2026</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>

    <div class="container proof-strip" aria-label="Journey at a glance">
      <div class="journey-progress"><strong>{completed} / 100</strong><span>Hackathons shipped · The finish line</span></div>
      <div><strong>{awarded}</strong><span>Awarded builds</span></div>
      <div><strong>25</strong><span>Wins</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section years-section" aria-labelledby="years-heading">
    <div class="container years-grid">
      <div><p class="meta">Since 2016</p><h2 id="years-heading">10 years in motion.</h2></div>
      <p>A decade of ideas tested, teams formed, and lessons carried into the next build. The journey keeps going—one hackathon at a time.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section story" id="story">
    <div class="container story-grid">
      <div class="story-heading">
        <p class="meta">Why this exists</p>
        <h2 class="serif">This is not a highlight reel.</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="story-copy">
        <p class="lede">
          Most portfolios preserve the polished ending. I’m interested in the
          messy middle—the decisions, trade-offs, failures, and people that
          turn an idea into something real.
        </p>
        <div class="story-columns">
          <p>
            Hackathons compress the entire product cycle into a deadline. In a
            weekend, an assumption becomes a prototype, a team becomes an
            operating system, and a vague idea has to survive contact with an
            audience.
          </p>
          <p>
            This public record captures what each attempt changed: what worked,
            what broke, who showed up, and which lesson is worth carrying into
            the next build—or the next business.
          </p>
        </div>
        <blockquote>“The goal is not to win one weekend. It is to become the person who can keep creating value after it.”</blockquote>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section career-section" aria-labelledby="career-heading">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-heading-row">
        <div>
          <p class="meta">Builder → operator</p>
          <h2 id="career-heading">The road so far.</h2>
        </div>
        <p>Each chapter moved me one step further from writing code on request toward choosing problems, aligning people, and owning outcomes.</p>
      </div>

      <ol class="career-track">
        {career.map(({ label, title, copy }) => (
          <li>
            <p class="career-label">{label}</p>
            <h3>{title}</h3>
            <p>{copy}</p>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section operating-section" aria-labelledby="operating-heading">
    <div class="container operating-grid">
      <div class="operating-heading">
        <p class="meta">Operating system</p>
        <h2 class="serif" id="operating-heading">What I’m training for.</h2>
        <p>Not just faster execution—better judgement about what deserves to exist, who it serves, and how it compounds.</p>
      </div>
      <ol class="principle-list">
        {principles.map(({ number, title, copy }) => (
          <li>
            <span>{number}</span>
            <div><h3>{title}</h3><p>{copy}</p></div>
          </li>
        ))}
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section contact-section" id="contact" aria-labelledby="contact-heading">
    <div class="container contact">
      <div class="contact-copy">
        <p class="meta">Build something meaningful</p>
        <h2 id="contact-heading">Invite me into the room where builders gather.</h2>
        <p>
          Speaking, mentoring, judging, AI workshops, hackathon programming, and
          collaborations around fast prototyping, AI agents, and builder culture.
        </p>
        <ul aria-label="Ways to collaborate">
          <li>Speaking</li><li>Judging</li><li>Mentoring</li><li>Workshops</li><li>Building</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <form action="mailto:hello@example.com" method="post" enctype="text/plain">
        <label>
          Name
          <input name="name" autocomplete="name" required />
        </label>
        <label>
          Email
          <input name="email" type="email" autocomplete="email" required />
        </label>
        <label>
          What are you planning?
          <textarea name="message" rows="5" required></textarea>
        </label>
        <button class="button primary" type="submit">Start the conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageShell>

<style>
  .about-hero { position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: var(--bg-paper); }
  .about-hero::before { position: absolute; inset: 0 0 auto; height: 7px; content: ""; background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--red) 0 58%, var(--yellow) 58% 74%, var(--blue) 74%); }
  .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.08fr) minmax(360px, .72fr); gap: clamp(42px, 7vw, 100px); align-items: center; min-height: 690px; padding-block: 82px 54px; }
  .hero-copy { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  h1 { max-width: 850px; margin: 20px 0 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: clamp(3.7rem, 7.4vw, 7.6rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: .88; }
  h1 em { color: var(--red); font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-weight: 500; }
  .hero-intro { max-width: 700px; margin: 32px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem); line-height: 1.7; }
  .hero-actions { display: flex; gap: 24px; align-items: center; margin-top: 34px; }
  .text-link { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ink); padding: 10px 0 6px; font-size: .86rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .text-link span { margin-left: 6px; color: var(--red); }

  .portrait { position: relative; margin: 0; border: 1px solid var(--black); background: var(--black); box-shadow: 18px 18px 0 var(--yellow); }
  .portrait::after { position: absolute; inset: 14px; border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 24%); content: ""; pointer-events: none; }
  .portrait img { width: 100%; height: auto; aspect-ratio: 4 / 5; object-fit: cover; }
  .portrait-index { position: absolute; z-index: 2; top: -37px; right: -18px; color: var(--red); font-size: clamp(5rem, 9vw, 8rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.08em; line-height: 1; }
  .portrait figcaption { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; padding: 13px 15px; background: var(--black); color: white; font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .portrait figcaption span:last-child { color: rgb(255 255 255 / 56%); }

  .proof-strip { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); }
  .proof-strip .journey-progress { grid-column: 1 / -1; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .years-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; align-items: center; }
  .years-grid p:last-child { color: var(--muted); }
  .years-section { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .proof-strip div { display: grid; gap: 4px; padding: 24px 20px; border-left: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .proof-strip div:last-child { border-right: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .proof-strip strong { color: var(--ink); font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.25rem); letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: 1; }
  .proof-strip span { color: var(--faint); font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .09em; text-transform: uppercase; }

  .story { background: var(--surface-warm); }
  .story-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, .72fr) minmax(0, 1.2fr); gap: clamp(48px, 9vw, 140px); align-items: start; }
  .story-heading { position: sticky; top: 140px; }
  .story h2, .operating-heading h2 { margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: clamp(3rem, 5.8vw, 6.3rem); line-height: .9; }
  .story-copy > .lede { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: clamp(1.45rem, 2.4vw, 2.15rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.025em; line-height: 1.28; }
  .story-columns { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 32px; margin-top: 42px; }
  .story-columns p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.75; }
  blockquote { margin: 52px 0 0; padding: 24px 0 0 26px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-left: 6px solid var(--red); color: var(--ink); font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); line-height: 1.35; }

  .career-section { border-block: 1px solid var(--line-strong); background: var(--bg-paper); }
  .section-heading-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(280px, .55fr); gap: 48px; align-items: end; }
  .section-heading-row h2 { margin: 14px 0 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.4rem); letter-spacing: -.05em; line-height: .9; }
  .section-heading-row > p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.7; }
  .career-track { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(5, 1fr); margin: 62px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .career-track li { position: relative; min-width: 0; padding: 36px 24px 8px 0; border-top: 2px solid var(--black); }
  .career-track li::before { position: absolute; top: -7px; left: 0; width: 12px; height: 12px; border-radius: 50%; content: ""; background: var(--red); }
  .career-label { margin: 0 0 20px; color: var(--red); font-size: .68rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .1em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  .career-track h3 { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); font-size: 1.1rem; line-height: 1.2; }
  .career-track li > p:last-child { margin: 12px 0 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: .88rem; line-height: 1.6; }

  .operating-section { background: var(--black); color: white; }
  .operating-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(280px, .75fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: clamp(48px, 9vw, 130px); }
  .operating-heading { align-self: start; }
  .operating-heading .meta { color: var(--yellow); }
  .operating-heading h2 { color: white; }
  .operating-heading > p:last-child { max-width: 520px; margin: 28px 0 0; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 58%); line-height: 1.7; }
  .principle-list { margin: 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .principle-list li { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 58px 1fr; gap: 18px; padding: 25px 0; border-top: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 20%); }
  .principle-list li:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 20%); }
  .principle-list > li > span { color: var(--red); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 500; }
  .principle-list h3 { margin: 0; font-size: 1.35rem; }
  .principle-list p { margin: 8px 0 0; color: rgb(255 255 255 / 56%); line-height: 1.6; }

  .contact-section { scroll-margin-top: 120px; background: var(--yellow); color: var(--black); }
  .contact { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(340px, .62fr); gap: clamp(44px, 8vw, 110px); align-items: start; }
  .contact .meta { color: var(--black); }
  .contact h2 { max-width: 820px; margin: 18px 0 0; color: var(--black); font-size: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 6.2rem); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -.055em; line-height: .89; }
  .contact-copy > p:not(.meta) { max-width: 680px; margin: 28px 0 0; font-size: 1.08rem; line-height: 1.7; }
  .contact-copy ul { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; margin: 28px 0 0; padding: 0; list-style: none; }
  .contact-copy li { padding: 7px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--black); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; }
  form { display: grid; gap: 16px; border: 1px solid var(--black); background: var(--bg-paper); box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--black); padding: 24px; }
  label { display: grid; gap: 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: .72rem; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
  input, textarea { width: 100%; border: 1px solid var(--line-strong); border-radius: 0; background: var(--raised); color: var(--text); padding: 13px 12px; }
  input:focus, textarea:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--red); outline-offset: 1px; }
  textarea { resize: vertical; }
  form button { width: 100%; cursor: pointer; }

  @media (max-width: 980px) {
    .hero-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(300px, .75fr); min-height: auto; }
    .career-track { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 0; }
    .career-track li { padding: 22px 0 22px 32px; border-top: 0; border-left: 2px solid var(--black); }
    .career-track li::before { top: 27px; left: -7px; }
    .career-label { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .hero-grid, .story-grid, .operating-grid, .contact, .section-heading-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .hero-grid { gap: 56px; padding-block: 62px 48px; }
    h1 { font-size: clamp(3.35rem, 15vw, 5.5rem); }
    .portrait { width: min(88%, 460px); margin-inline: auto; box-shadow: 12px 12px 0 var(--yellow); }
    .proof-strip { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
    .years-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .proof-strip div { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    .story-heading { position: static; }
    .story-columns { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 12px; }
    .career-track { margin-top: 42px; }
    .contact { gap: 40px; }
  }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .hero-actions { align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
    .proof-strip strong { font-size: 2.4rem; }
    .proof-strip div { padding-inline: 14px; }
    .portrait-index { right: -10px; }
    form { padding: 18px; box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 var(--black); }
  }
</style>
